you can't improve on a perfection, which is, you know, the wooded

00:20:11.845 --> 00:20:12.325
lot there,

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.030
the easiest thing to do is tell

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:21.590
the developers, the property owners that they should capture all the

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.790
stormwater ring runoff from the roof and the driveway.

00:20:28.345 --> 00:20:29.145
And that

00:20:29.385 --> 00:20:30.345
