nothing's changed from before. Instead of 100 square feet, now we're worried about 200 square feet, a little further away from the lake, a little less restrictive,

00:24:15.655 --> 00:24:17.095
and we're going down to

00:24:17.415 --> 00:24:18.935
7.5%

00:24:19.095 --> 00:24:19.895
reduction

00:24:19.895 --> 00:24:21.335
as opposed to 10%.

