00:24:36.470 --> 00:24:39.270
you know, instead of 100 or 200, we go to 300.

00:24:40.185 --> 00:24:40.905
In

00:24:41.225 --> 00:24:42.345
the amount

00:24:42.345 --> 00:24:44.825
