00:25:08.645 --> 00:25:09.845
area is

00:25:10.565 --> 00:25:11.285
and

00:25:12.725 --> 00:25:15.045
that's it for Zone D. Nothing's

00:25:15.045 --> 00:25:17.365
changed there since we talked about that before.

00:25:20.085 --> 00:25:22.085
Okay, 7.6.9

00:25:22.085 --> 00:25:24.485
just talks about

00:25:23.710 --> 00:25:27.630
not every runoff coefficient in the world is listed on our worksheet.

00:25:28.990 --> 00:25:31.870
If they have some basis for some different

00:25:32.830 --> 00:25:34.510
thing than what we've got there,

00:25:36.030 --> 00:25:37.710
Jim's willing to entertain

00:25:37.710 --> 00:25:38.030
that.

00:25:41.285 --> 00:25:43.845
Moving on to 7.6.10,

00:25:43.845 --> 00:25:44.725
this is the

00:25:45.125 --> 00:25:47.765
one time small surface change which is

00:25:48.085 --> 00:25:52.885
if we're doing an area less than 100 for A, 200 for B, 300 for C,

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:54.960
Jim can

00:25:55.760 --> 00:25:56.480
do

00:25:56.880 --> 00:26:00.400
a little rain garden or a trench filled with stone and

00:26:00.640 --> 00:26:03.680
you know, it talks about the dimensions there and

00:26:04.160 --> 00:26:05.360
just mitigate it that way.

00:26:11.295 --> 00:26:12.015
Okay,

00:26:12.415 --> 00:26:13.855
7.6.11

00:26:13.855 --> 00:26:14.575
is

00:26:14.815 --> 00:26:16.735
best management practices.

00:26:16.895 --> 00:26:20.575
No changes there from what we had talked about before.

00:26:22.520 --> 00:26:23.640
Was your question?

00:26:27.080 --> 00:26:28.200
Nope? Okay.

00:26:37.045 --> 00:26:43.445
Modification of lake watershed by special permit. So if somebody thinks that they can't

00:26:43.445 --> 00:26:47.045
comply with our nutrient allocation worksheet requirements,

00:26:48.590 --> 00:26:55.550
And I think that's a pretty tough sell that they wouldn't be able to do that. They may not want to be able to do that, but that's a different matter.

00:26:56.030 --> 00:26:56.590
They

00:26:57.070 --> 00:26:58.590
can come to the Commission

00:26:58.990 --> 00:27:00.270
