00:27:08.725 --> 00:27:09.525
before

00:27:10.405 --> 00:27:12.485
we grant that special permit.

00:27:12.645 --> 00:27:15.525
And again, that's not an awful lot of

00:27:18.210 --> 00:27:22.050
reduction in what they would be doing by the nutrient alloy worksheet.

00:27:25.970 --> 00:27:27.090
Happy there.

