Next section is if the property is not within the Andover Lake watershed,

00:27:34.785 --> 00:27:35.425
you know,

00:27:35.985 --> 00:27:39.825
can come talk to Jim. He can check the map, check

00:27:40.385 --> 00:27:45.505
them with them and if he agrees that it's not in the watershed, they

